  "ruleText": "Env-A 1101.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to regulate emissions from all motor vehicles pursuant to RSA 125-C:6, XII.\n\nSource. #120, eff 8-31-73; ss by #721.9, eff 12-7-75; ss by #1717, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; ss by #6343-B, eff 9-28-96, EXPIRED: 9-28-04\n\nNew. #8200, INTERIM, eff 11-6-04, EXPIRES: 5-5-05; ss by #8313, eff 3-26-05; ss by #10345, eff 5-22-13; ss by #13680, eff 7-1-23",
